---
import BaseLayout from "@layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Learn about Xychen, the creator-led website for game content, guides, discoveries, and updates."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container narrow-content">
      <p class="eyebrow">About Xychen</p>
      <h1>A place for games and <span>curiosity.</span></h1>
      <p class="page-lead">Xychen is a personal creator website for sharing game-related content, useful information, and projects in one organized place.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section-block">
    <div class="container narrow-content prose">
      <h2>What this website is</h2>
      <p>This website brings together Xychen's content and interests. Its current focus includes Roblox, Grow a Garden, practical guides, tips, discoveries, and game updates. It can expand to other games and projects over time.</p>

      <h2>What you can find here</h2>
      <p>Content may include tutorials, explainers, game mechanics, useful details, discoveries, and updates. The goal is to make information easier to browse and understand, rather than collect unrelated features in one place.</p>

      <h2>Accuracy and sources</h2>
      <p>Information from external sources should include a source readers can check. Time-sensitive details should include relevant dates.</p>
      <p>Leaks, rumors, and unverified claims must be clearly marked as <strong>unconfirmed</strong>. They should never be presented as official announcements or established facts.</p>

      <h2>Community</h2>
      <p>Xychen Community is the Discord server connected to this website. It is one way to connect with the community; it does not define the entire purpose of the Xychen website.</p>
      <p><a href="https://discord.com/invite/xychen-server-1417846380432719915" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit Xychen Community ↗</a></p>

      <h2>Still evolving</h2>
      <p>The website will develop in stages. New sections should have a clear purpose and meet practical requirements for accuracy, usability, accessibility, and maintainability.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
